# m5max-40c-swift15-kquant-v2.choices: v1 (below) plus the DFlash draft's affine projections at 1-4 lanes
# from m5max-40c-swift15-v12.choices (every GGUF model runs Inco's affine DFlash2 draft; v1 left it on
# defaults). Affine lines key affine workloads only, so the GGUF target is unchanged.
